# ESP32-CAM Security Monitoring System

## Project Overview

This project is a cybersecurity-focused IoT monitoring system using the ESP32-CAM. The ESP32 connects to WiFi, creates its own Access Point, and communicates with a Telegram bot to send photos remotely. The project demonstrates wireless networking, remote monitoring, and IoT communication concepts.

---

## Cybersecurity Purpose

The purpose of this project is to demonstrate how IoT devices can be used for remote monitoring and wireless communication in cybersecurity environments. The ESP32-CAM can send images remotely through Telegram and operate as both a WiFi client and an Access Point.

