## Installation / Configuration Steps

1. Installed Arduino IDE
2. Installed ESP32 board package
3. Selected AI Thinker ESP32-CAM board
4. Configured WiFi credentials
5. Configured Telegram bot token and Chat ID
6. Uploaded code using BOOT and RESET buttons
7. Opened Serial Monitor
8. Verified WiFi connection
9. Verified Access Point mode
10. Tested Telegram photo command

